      "title": "Overview",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "MongoDB Atlas Flex tier (GA: February 6, 2025) is the successor to both the shared tier (M2/M5) and the serverless tier. As of January 22, 2026, M2/M5 clusters and Serverless instances are end-of-life and no longer supported - all existing instances were automatically migrated. Flex is now the entry-level paid cluster in Atlas.",
